{#- Sent when a credit note is created, with its PDF attached. -#}
{% extends "email/base.j2" %}
{% block subject %}Credit note {{ note_number }} issued — {{ note_amount }}{% endblock %}
{% block content %}Dear {{ contact_name | default(customer_name, true) }},

We have issued credit note {{ note_number }} for {{ note_amount }} in your
favour{% if note_reason %} ({{ note_reason }}){% endif %}. The credit note
document is attached for your records.

You may instruct us to adjust this credit against any open or future
invoice — simply quote {{ note_number }} (or ask us to apply available
credit) in your payment advice.{% endblock %}
